{"id": "ja-akutagawa-kappa-p7-mist", "kind": "image", "suite": "passages", "category": "historical_manuscript", "media": "passages/kappa-p7-mist.jpg", "reference": "つた訣ではありません。それから又放牧の馬\nや牛も突然僕の前へ顔を出しました。けれど\nもそれ等は見えたと思ふと、忽ち又濛々とし\nた霧の中に隠れてしまふのです。そのうちに", "language": "ja", "group": "akutagawa-kappa-manuscript", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NDL2541083_%E6%B2%B3%E7%AB%A5.pdf", "source_media_url": "https://dl.ndl.go.jp/api/iiif/2541083/R0000005/full/2400,/0/default.jpg", "transcript_source_url": "https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000879/files/45761_39095.html", "transcript_granularity": "four columns verified visually against the old-kana edition", "license": "Public domain", "credit": "Ryūnosuke Akutagawa, Kappa autograph manuscript, National Diet Library (PID 2541083)", "writing_direction": "vertical_right_to_left", "line_count": 4, "transcript_policy": "Use main text, preserving old kana and representing repetition signs as printed. Ignore marginal ruby readings.", "crop": {"canvas": "R0000005", "printed_page": 7, "source_width": 2400, "x": 490, "y": 310, "width": 340, "height": 1250}, "sha256": "899e7b5b654524a515c17093c46dc2cc0cd58dfbdd38f7873d025afb8e75bc3a"}
